  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved entrepreneurship skills</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO will contribute to strengthening entrepreneurship by building the skills required to start and grow businesses, expanding opportunities for sustainable business recovery, and fostering an environment that supports small enterprise development in Ukraine. Support will combine entrepreneurship training using the ILO&#x2019;s &#x201c;Start and Improve Your Business&#x201d; methodology, assistance with business-plan development, grant support and business advisory services to help viable start-ups launch and existing businesses resume or expand their operations. By building the capacity of local entrepreneurs and reinforcing the ecosystem for small business development, the intervention will support local job creation, greater economic resilience and a more sustainable recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
